{
 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.21,
   "text": "6:13 in the evening, Kaliningrad:"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.442,
   "end": 4.64,
   "text": "the first nuclear weapon"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.64,
   "end": 6.55,
   "text": "used since Nagasaki."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.039,
   "end": 8.505,
   "text": "This is a simulation,"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.505,
   "end": 10.07,
   "text": "and it has not happened."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.7,
   "end": 12.07,
   "text": "3 minutes earlier."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.62,
   "end": 14.14,
   "text": "A missile leaves a launcher in"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.14,
   "end": 15.75,
   "text": "the west of the enclave."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.232,
   "end": 17.51,
   "text": "It is an Iskander,"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.691,
   "end": 19.97,
   "text": "and it flies 98 km."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.079,
   "end": 22.42,
   "text": "Its target is open ground"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.42,
   "end": 24.19,
   "text": "chosen by the simulation,"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.39,
   "end": 26.05,
   "text": "inside Russia itself."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.613,
   "end": 28.7,
   "text": "Why would Russia fire a nuclear"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.7,
   "end": 30.45,
   "text": "weapon at its own land?"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.676,
   "end": 32.02,
   "text": "And what does NATO do"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.02,
   "end": 33.71,
   "text": "in the hour after?"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.288,
   "end": 35.86,
   "text": "13 days of pressure"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.86,
   "end": 37.11,
   "text": "lead to this minute,"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.266,
   "end": 38.5,
   "text": "and the answer starts"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.5,
   "end": 39.49,
   "text": "with a road."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.306,
   "end": 41.94,
   "text": "On the thirtieth of September,"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.94,
   "end": 43.03,
   "text": "2026,"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.349,
   "end": 45.66,
   "text": "Russia's embassy in Dublin said Russia"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.66,
   "end": 48.02,
   "text": "would use \"all its arsenal,"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.02,
   "end": 50.62,
   "text": "including nuclear weapons\" if NATO"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.62,
   "end": 52.88,
   "text": "tried to isolate Kaliningrad."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.88,
   "end": 54.78,
   "text": "Reuters reported the same warning in"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.78,
   "end": 56.97,
   "text": "a formal note to NATO states."
  }
 ],
